1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:10,028
Gummy can now calculate. Formulas compute a value, rules pick one, and conditions show, hide or enable anything, all as configuration.

2
00:00:10,978 --> 00:00:18,181
This form is config alone. Type a quantity and a price, and the subtotal, the discount and the total follow as you go.

3
00:00:18,181 --> 00:00:22,156
Cross ten thousand, and a rule moves the discount to its next tier.

4
00:00:22,156 --> 00:00:29,887
Pick Business. The company field appears, and the tax ID becomes required. A hidden field is neither validated nor sent.

5
00:00:30,337 --> 00:00:37,306
In Gummy Studio, every item has a logic panel, and a condition is built by picking, not by typing syntax.

6
00:00:37,306 --> 00:00:42,821
The operators and the value follow the field: its options here, a number box for a number.

7
00:00:43,572 --> 00:00:48,313
Saved rules sit in the same list, so a condition used twice is written once.

8
00:00:48,763 --> 00:00:53,670
Formulas get one smart bar. Start from a template, or just type a word.

9
00:00:53,670 --> 00:01:00,988
It suggests fields, functions and saved formulas, writes the right syntax, and shows what each function needs next.

10
00:01:00,988 --> 00:01:07,152
Choose how the result is shown, and Try it runs the real engine on sample values, already filled in.

11
00:01:08,187 --> 00:01:14,947
A rule is a stack of cards: if, else if, otherwise. Checked from the top, the first match wins.

12
00:01:14,947 --> 00:01:20,311
Change a sample, and the matching card moves with it, with a tick or a cross on every line.

13
00:01:21,707 --> 00:01:26,841
The Logic tab shows where each saved item is used, one click from the item itself.

14
00:01:29,007 --> 00:01:32,964
Rename a field, and the studio offers to bring its logic along.

15
00:01:35,045 --> 00:01:42,316
And it all runs from JSON in the real app. The Book shop reads the next step on an order from a rule, and its age from a formula.

16
00:01:42,316 --> 00:01:45,995
Another order, another answer, with no code behind it.

17
00:01:46,695 --> 00:01:51,112
Gummy UI. Configure the logic, and keep your code for the business.
